---
import PolicyLayout from "../../components/PolicyLayout.astro";
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Privacy Policy for Luxury Furniture | VIRELLAART"
  description="Learn how VIRELLAART collects, uses and protects information received through its website, WhatsApp and customer communications."
>
  <p>
    VIRELLAART respects the privacy of website visitors, customers and business
    contacts. This policy explains the types of information we may receive and
    how that information may be used.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We May Collect</h2>

  <p>
    We may receive personal and business information when you contact us through
    the website, WhatsApp, email, social media or another communication channel.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>Name and contact details</li>
    <li>Country, city or delivery destination</li>
    <li>Product and collection enquiries</li>
    <li>Project, measurement and customization information</li>
    <li>Quotation, order and delivery communications</li>
    <li>Technical website information such as browser and device data</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Information</h2>

  <p>
    Information may be used to answer enquiries, prepare quotations, coordinate
    production, manage orders, arrange delivery, provide customer support and
    improve our website and services.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics and Cookies</h2>

  <p>
    Our website may use analytics technologies and cookies to understand general
    website usage, improve performance and measure interactions such as page
    visits and contact-button activity.
  </p>

  <h2>Information Sharing</h2>

  <p>
    VIRELLAART does not sell personal information. Information may be shared
    only when reasonably necessary with service providers involved in payment,
    production, packaging, logistics, website operation or legal compliance.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Protection</h2>

  <p>
    We use reasonable organizational and technical measures to protect the
    information under our control. However, no internet communication or digital
    storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Retention</h2>

  <p>
    Information may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to manage
    enquiries, quotations, orders, customer service, legal obligations and
    legitimate business records.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Privacy Requests</h2>

  <p>
    You may contact VIRELLAART to request information about personal data you
    previously provided or to ask for an appropriate correction or deletion,
    subject to applicable legal and business-record requirements.
  </p>

  <h2>Policy Updates</h2>

  <p>
    This Privacy Policy may be updated when our website, services or legal
    obligations change. The latest version will remain available on this page.
  </p>
</PolicyLayout>